NAME
    gcloud beta service-health organization-impacts - represents impact to
        assets at organizational level

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta service-health organization-impacts COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Represents impact to assets at organizational level.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (BETA) Get details of an asset impact by an event under an
        organization.

     list
        (BETA) List assets impacted by events under an organization.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. These
    variants are also available:

        $ gcloud service-health organization-impacts

        $ gcloud alpha service-health organization-impacts

